<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Powers- Makes you alert, blocks oxytocin, increases heart rate and gets ready for fight or flight.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

221 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Where to find- In places with fear or anxiety, and at the end of labour where she decides to do some good! Love her or hate her she has her uses and she\220s not always evil!)/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

222 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Weaknesses- Can\220t help but get involved when they think you\220re not feeling safe and calm.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

223 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Uh Oh! When it\220s not the right time, it\220s presence will slow or stop birth making the process longer and less comfortable.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

224 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Powers- Fills you with love, makes you feel euphoric, contracts your uterus, tells your breasts to release milk, bonds you to baby. It can do all of this in pregnancy, during labour/birth and after!)/Pg 17 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

225 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Where to find- Anywhere there\220s laughter, love, snuggles, massage, nipple/clitoral stimulation and all the good stuff! Try some chocolate and a funny movie!)/Pg 17 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

226 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Weaknesses- Hates being observed, being around strangers and unfamiliar places. VERY shy.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

227 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 95 0 R/E(Everybody loves Oxytocin \(except that pesky adrenaline\), you want to encourage Oxytocin to show her face as much as you can!)/Pg 17 0 R/K[10]>>
