<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 97 0 R/E(Powers- Brain washes you to want to care for your baby no matter how tired you are, no matter what they need. Compliments oxytocin and aids bonding with baby. Encourages your body to make milk for baby.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

258 0 obj
